{"seq":3,"slug":"code-style-enforcement","title":"代码风格强制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-craftsmanship/code-quality-standards/code-style-enforcement","wordCount":1805,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"代码风格强制\">代码风格强制</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>代码风格强制的核心判断是：风格没有绝对正确，只有一致性，因此应把风格决策一次性固化为工具配置，把人的注意力释放给逻辑与架构。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>一致性高于正确性</strong>：风格是团队约定而非真理，选定后用工具固化，不再反复讨论。</li>\n<li><strong>分层工具链</strong>：编辑器层（EditorConfig）→ 格式化层（Prettier）→ 静态分析层（ESLint/Biome）→ CI 层，各司其职。</li>\n<li><strong>职责分工</strong>：格式化工具只处理排版（空格、引号、换行），静态分析工具只处理质量与潜在缺陷，两者不重叠。</li>\n<li><strong>检查前移</strong>：预提交钩子（husky + lint-staged）在提交前拦截，CI 作为最终防线。</li>\n<li><strong>规则可裁剪</strong>：样式规则、质量规则与格式规则混在一起时，只保留能防止真实缺陷的部分，避免噪音掩盖信号。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本文后续的工具链全景、EditorConfig/Prettier/ESLint/Biome 配置、预提交与 CI 集成，都是这些概念的具体落地。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么需要强制风格\">为什么需要强制风格</h2><p>代码风格争论是团队中最常见的&quot;自行车棚问题&quot;——每个人都有自己偏好的缩进方式、括号位置和引号类型。手动维护风格一致性既低效又容易引发不必要的摩擦。自动化风格强制让团队将注意力从格式争论转移到真正重要的事情上：逻辑正确性和架构质量。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[人工检查风格] --&gt; B[评审中 30% 时间花在格式]&#10;    A --&gt; C[不同人标准不同]&#10;    A --&gt; D[容易遗漏]&#10;    E[自动化强制] --&gt; F[评审聚焦业务逻辑]&#10;    E --&gt; G[标准统一且确定]&#10;    E --&gt; H[零遗漏]\">graph LR\n    A[人工检查风格] --&gt; B[评审中 30% 时间花在格式]\n    A --&gt; C[不同人标准不同]\n    A --&gt; D[容易遗漏]\n    E[自动化强制] --&gt; F[评审聚焦业务逻辑]\n    E --&gt; G[标准统一且确定]\n    E --&gt; H[零遗漏]</pre><p>Google 的工程实践手册明确指出：代码风格没有绝对正确，重要的是<strong>一致性</strong>。一旦团队选定了风格，就通过工具固化它，不再反复讨论。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"工具链全景\">工具链全景</h2><p>现代前端工程中，代码风格保障的工具链分为三个层次：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>作用范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>编辑器层</td>\n<td>EditorConfig</td>\n<td>统一基础编辑器行为</td>\n<td>缩进、换行符、尾行空行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>格式化层</td>\n<td>Prettier / dprint</td>\n<td>自动格式化代码</td>\n<td>空格、括号、换行、引号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>静态分析层</td>\n<td>ESLint / Biome</td>\n<td>检查代码质量和潜在问题</td>\n<td>逻辑错误、最佳实践、复杂度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CI 层</td>\n<td>GitHub Actions / GitLab CI</td>\n<td>阻止不合规代码合并</td>\n<td>最终防线</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[开发者编写代码] --&gt; B[EditorConfig 统一基础格式]&#10;    B --&gt; C[保存时 Prettier 自动格式化]&#10;    C --&gt; D[ESLint 检查代码质量]&#10;    D --&gt; E{通过?}&#10;    E --&gt;|否| F[IDE 红色波浪线提示]&#10;    F --&gt; A&#10;    E --&gt;|是| G[git commit]&#10;    G --&gt; H[husky + lint-staged 预提交检查]&#10;    H --&gt; I{通过?}&#10;    I --&gt;|否| J[阻止提交]&#10;    J --&gt; A&#10;    I --&gt;|是| K[推送到远程]&#10;    K --&gt; L[CI 流水线再次检查]&#10;    L --&gt; M{通过?}&#10;    M --&gt;|否| N[阻止合并]&#10;    M --&gt;|是| O[允许合并]\">flowchart TD\n    A[开发者编写代码] --&gt; B[EditorConfig 统一基础格式]\n    B --&gt; C[保存时 Prettier 自动格式化]\n    C --&gt; D[ESLint 检查代码质量]\n    D --&gt; E{通过?}\n    E --&gt;|否| F[IDE 红色波浪线提示]\n    F --&gt; A\n    E --&gt;|是| G[git commit]\n    G --&gt; H[husky + lint-staged 预提交检查]\n    H --&gt; I{通过?}\n    I --&gt;|否| J[阻止提交]\n    J --&gt; A\n    I --&gt;|是| K[推送到远程]\n    K --&gt; L[CI 流水线再次检查]\n    L --&gt; M{通过?}\n    M --&gt;|否| N[阻止合并]\n    M --&gt;|是| O[允许合并]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"editorconfig-配置\">EditorConfig 配置</h2><p>EditorConfig 是所有风格统一的起点，因为它不依赖任何具体的语言工具链：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ini\" data-code=\"root = true&#10;&#10;[*]&#10;indent_style = space&#10;indent_size = 2&#10;end_of_line = lf&#10;charset = utf-8&#10;trim_trailing_whitespace = true&#10;insert_final_newline = true&#10;&#10;[*.md]&#10;trim_trailing_whitespace = false&#10;&#10;[Makefile]&#10;indent_style = tab\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>root = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[*]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>indent_style = space</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>indent_size = 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end_of_line = lf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>charset = utf-8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>trim_trailing_whitespace = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>insert_final_newline = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[*.md]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>trim_trailing_whitespace = false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[Makefile]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>indent_style = tab</span></span></code></pre></div><p>几乎所有主流编辑器都原生支持或通过插件支持 EditorConfig。它解决了最基础的格式统一问题——缩进用空格还是 Tab、换行符用 LF 还是 CRLF。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"prettier-格式化的终极方案\">Prettier：格式化的终极方案</h2><p>Prettier 是一个有主见的 (Opinionated) 代码格式化工具。它的核心理念是<strong>减少配置项</strong>，让团队在格式问题上没有争论空间。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;semi&quot;: true,&#10;  &quot;singleQuote&quot;: true,&#10;  &quot;tabWidth&quot;: 2,&#10;  &quot;trailingComma&quot;: &quot;all&quot;,&#10;  &quot;printWidth&quot;: 100,&#10;  &quot;bracketSpacing&quot;: true,&#10;  &quot;arrowParens&quot;: &quot;always&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"semi\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"singleQuote\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tabWidth\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"trailingComma\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"all\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"printWidth\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"bracketSpacing\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"arrowParens\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"always\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"prettier-vs-手动格式化\">Prettier vs 手动格式化</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>手动格式化</th>\n<th>Prettier</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一致性</td>\n<td>依赖个人习惯</td>\n<td>100% 一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>速度</td>\n<td>边写边调整</td>\n<td>保存时自动完成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>评审负担</td>\n<td>需要人工检查格式</td>\n<td>完全消除格式讨论</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习成本</td>\n<td>需要记忆团队规范</td>\n<td>无需记忆，工具自动处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冲突风险</td>\n<td>不同开发者格式不同导致 diff 噪音</td>\n<td>确定性输出，无格式冲突</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"prettier-与-eslint-的分工\">Prettier 与 ESLint 的分工</h3><p>一个常见误区是用 ESLint 来做格式化。现代实践的共识是<strong>格式化归 Prettier，逻辑检查归 ESLint</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import eslint from &#39;@eslint/js&#39;;&#10;import tseslint from &#39;typescript-eslint&#39;;&#10;import prettier from &#39;eslint-config-prettier&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default tseslint.config(eslint.configs.recommended, ...tseslint.configs.recommended, prettier);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> eslint </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@eslint/js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tseslint </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'typescript-eslint'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prettier </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'eslint-config-prettier'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tseslint.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">config</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(eslint.configs.recommended, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tseslint.configs.recommended, prettier);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>eslint-config-prettier</code> 的作用是关闭 ESLint 中所有与 Prettier 冲突的规则，确保两者和平共处。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"eslint-深度配置\">ESLint 深度配置</h2><p>ESLint 9+ 采用了全新的 Flat Config 格式，配置文件为 <code>eslint.config.mjs</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"import eslint from &#39;@eslint/js&#39;;&#10;import tseslint from &#39;typescript-eslint&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default tseslint.config(&#10;  eslint.configs.recommended,&#10;  ...tseslint.configs.strictTypeChecked,&#10;  {&#10;    languageOptions: {&#10;      parserOptions: {&#10;        projectService: true,&#10;        tsconfigRootDir: import.meta.dirname,&#10;      },&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    rules: {&#10;      &#39;max-lines-per-function&#39;: [&#39;warn&#39;, { max: 30, skipBlankLines: true, skipComments: true }],&#10;      complexity: [&#39;warn&#39;, 10],&#10;      &#39;max-depth&#39;: [&#39;warn&#39;, 3],&#10;      &#39;max-params&#39;: [&#39;warn&#39;, 3],&#10;      &#39;no-nested-ternary&#39;: &#39;error&#39;,&#10;      &#39;@typescript-eslint/no-explicit-any&#39;: &#39;error&#39;,&#10;      &#39;@typescript-eslint/explicit-function-return-type&#39;: [&#10;        &#39;warn&#39;,&#10;        {&#10;          allowExpressions: true,&#10;          allowTypedFunctionExpressions: true,&#10;        },&#10;      ],&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> eslint </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@eslint/js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tseslint </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'typescript-eslint'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tseslint.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">config</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  eslint.configs.recommended,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tseslint.configs.strictTypeChecked,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    languageOptions: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      parserOptions: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        projectService: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        tsconfigRootDir: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">meta</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.dirname,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    rules: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      'max-lines-per-function'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'warn'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { max: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, skipBlankLines: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, skipComments: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      complexity: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'warn'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      'max-depth'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'warn'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--s